  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have received basic training from the Grand Army of the Republic and know how to turn even bulky armor into an asset.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Armor_Proficiency_(Light)\" title=\"Armor Proficiency (Light)\">Armor Proficiency (Light)</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> If you wear Armor that provides an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>, and you are proficient with that Armor, you also apply the Armor's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>.</p>",
